#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:16
msgid ""
"The session-authority modules implement ephemeral, connection-bound "
"access leases for one profile and one runtime boot. The authority keeps "
"non-secret lease records in memory; its trusted owner supplies live "
"transport, login, lifecycle, clock, and profile observations, while "
"durable automation grants remain in the custody store. The integration "
"contract explicitly excludes client-deserialized facts as authority. "
"Calls that inspect or exercise permissions run under the owner's "
"admission guard, which is intended to serialize them with revocation, "
"administration, and private effects. session_authority_contracts.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/session_authority_contracts.py`) "
"session_authority_contracts.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/session_authority_contracts.py`) "
"session_authority_access.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/session_authority_access.py`)"
msgstr ""
"A munkamenet-felhatalmazási modulok átmeneti, kapcsolathoz kötött "
"hozzáférési bérleteket valósítanak meg egy profilhoz és a "
"futtatókörnyezet egy indulásához. A felhatalmazási komponens nem titkos "
"bérletrekordokat tart memóriában; megbízható felelőse élő átviteli, "
"bejelentkezési, életciklus-, óra- és profilmegfigyeléseket ad, míg a "
"tartós automatizálási engedélyek az őrzési tárban maradnak. Az "
"integrációs szerződés kifejezetten kizárja az ügyféltől deszerializált "
"tényeket a felhatalmazás forrásai közül. A jogosultságokat vizsgáló vagy "
"gyakorló hívások a felelős befogadási őre alatt futnak, amelynek célja, "
"hogy sorosítsa őket a visszavonással, adminisztrációval és privát "
"hatásokkal. session_authority_contracts.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/session_authority_contracts.py`) "
"session_authority_contracts.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/session_authority_contracts.py`) "
"session_authority_access.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/session_authority_access.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:18
msgid ""
"Human admission builds a candidate only from the existing bound profile "
"login. It checks the returned profile identity, live connection/client "
"facts, lock generation, and original monotonic deadline, binds that "
"candidate to the exact worker, then rechecks before publishing its lease."
" API-key admission separately checks the requested binding, resolves a "
"key identifier, and proves possession by unwrapping with the supplied "
"secret bytes. It constrains expiry to the configured lease maximum and "
"the stored grant/key windows, intersects requested, grant, and profile "
"scopes, prepares the exact worker, rechecks the original custody snapshot"
" and deadline, activates profile-bound custody, and publishes only after "
"successful activation. Candidate cleanup is retained for retry if "
"physical retirement fails. session_authority_admission.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/session_authority_admission.py`) "
