#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:28
msgid ""
"The validator also warns when a `valid_to` boundary cannot affect the "
"current profile projection: readers order by `valid_from` and lack an "
"`as_of` coordinate. If no later value supersedes a fact, it can keep "
"resolving after its recorded end date. This is explicitly surfaced as a "
"warning rather than silently presented as temporal enforcement. "
"validation.py (`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) "
"validation.py (`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`)"
msgstr ""
"A validáló arra is figyelmeztet, amikor egy `valid_to` határ nem "
"befolyásolhatja az aktuális profilvetületet: az olvasók `valid_from` "
"szerint rendeznek, és nincs `as_of` koordinátájuk. Ha egy tényt nem vált "
"fel későbbi érték, a rögzített végdátuma után is feloldódhat. Ezt "
"kifejezetten figyelmeztetésként jelzi, nem mutatja be észrevétlenül "
"időbeli érvényesítésként. validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`) validation.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/validation.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:30
msgid ""
"The usage-ratio resolver fills unconfigured home-office categories from "
"the taxpayer's own censo-declared floor-area facts and the operation-"
"pinned ratio vocabulary, while a stored override takes precedence. It "
"does not invent an area measurement from a registry default. The module "
"describes the relevant statutory background, but this report treats that "
"as product-supplied rationale and does not certify the legal "
"interpretation. usage_ratio_resolution.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/usage_ratio_resolution.py`)"
msgstr ""
"A használatiarány-feloldó a nem konfigurált otthoni irodai kategóriákat "
"az adózó saját, adózói törzsadatként deklarált alapterületi tényeiből és "
"a művelethez rögzített arányszókészletből tölti ki, miközben a tárolt "
"felülbírálás elsőbbséget élvez. Nem talál ki területmérést nyilvántartási"
" alapértékből. A modul leírja a releváns jogszabályi hátteret, de ez a "
"jelentés azt a termék által adott indoklásként kezeli, és nem hitelesíti "
"a jogértelmezést. usage_ratio_resolution.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/application/user_profile/usage_ratio_resolution.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/106-profile-session-authority-access-leases-and-delegation.md:32
msgid ""
"The view operation exposes five streams: facts, validation issues, "
"readiness issues, schema overview, and status. Requests cap page size at "
"32 and require revision and digest pins together; any continuation "
"requires a pin. Results enforce stream-specific item types, valid cursor "
"arithmetic, all-or-refused pages, and a one-item complete status page. "
"The reader opens the current encrypted record through the authenticated "
"session repository, validates it against the pinned schema, checks the "
"caller's expected revision/digest, and returns pages limited to 20,000 "
"serialized UTF-8 bytes. An individual oversized item yields an explicit "
"refusal instead of a partial item. The fact stream exposes the record's "
"canonical values under the profile-values result path; the overview "
"stream uses the shared masked overview and refuses unsupported actionable"
" notices; status includes only a fixed allowlist of "
"identity/activity/regime/residence facts. Result projection further "
"requires the matching settled operation definition and exact profile "
"subject. view_operation.py "
